problem_text:
试说明下列各式的物理意义：
(1) $f(v)= rac{dN}{Nd v}$;
(2) $f(v)d v$;
(3)$N f(v) d v$;
(4)$\int_{v_1}^{v_2} f(v) d v$;
(5)$\int_{v_1}^{v_2} N f(v) d v$;
(6)$ rac{\int_{v_1}^{v_2} v f(v) d v}{\int_{v_1}^{v_2} f(v) d v}$;
(7)$N \int_{v_1}^{v_2}  rac{1}{2}m_f v^2 f(v) d v$;
(8)$ rac{\int_{v_1}^{v_2} rac{1}{2}m_f v^2 f(v) d v}{\int_{v_1}^{v_2} f(v) d v}$。
